{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_012kLFNHsFyWoEboCB8cH9kK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016v48fAnR7zcwdG7voY53W9","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/engine/casting.py","old_string":"    # Ensure card.controller is set so the hook can reference \"you\" / the\n    # casting player even when the card was never explicitly assigned one.\n    prev_controller = card.controller\n    card.controller = controller\n    raw = card.cost_reduction(game)\n    # Restore previous controller in case the caller doesn't want a\n    # side-effect (get_cost_reduction is a query, not a mutation).\n    card.controller = prev_controller\n    generic = card.mana_cost.generic if card.mana_cost else 0\n    return max(0, min(raw, generic))","new_string":"    # Ensure card.controller is set so the hook can reference \"you\" / the\n    # casting player even when the card was never explicitly assigned one.\n    prev_controller = card.controller\n    card.controller = controller\n    raw = card.cost_reduction(game)\n    # Restore previous controller in case the caller doesn't want a\n    # side-effect (get_cost_reduction is a query, not a mutation).\n    card.controller = prev_controller\n\n    # Add reductions granted by the caster's battlefield permanents\n    # (e.g. \"instant and sorcery spells you cast have affinity for\n    # creatures\").  Limited to instant/sorcery spells.\n    if card.card_types & {CardType.INSTANT, CardType.SORCERY}:\n        for permanent in game.get_battlefield(controller).get_all():\n            if permanent is card:\n                continue\n            hook = getattr(permanent, \"spell_cost_reduction\", None)\n            if callable(hook):\n                raw += hook(game, card)\n\n    generic = card.mana_cost.generic if card.mana_cost else 0\n    return max(0, min(raw, generic))"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"s