{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_0155kndJT9t9H9MFDyG6vXMg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018jbh54121gYQBin1wHUMKz","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"- **sos_1 / \"may cast target\":** one prompt either way — unique candidate is\n  auto-selected with a yes/no for the \"may\"; multiple candidates use a single\n  `choose_card` where `None` declines.","new_string":"- **sos_1 / \"may cast target\":** one prompt either way — unique candidate is\n  auto-selected with a yes/no for the \"may\"; multiple candidates use a single\n  `choose_card` where `None` declines.\n- **sos_257 / restricted mana:** `ManaPool` keeps a separate\n  `_restricted_pool`; `can_pay`/`pay` take `for_instant_sorcery=` (default\n  False → behavior unchanged). Restricted mana is spent before normal mana of\n  the same type. \"Instant/sorcery only\" is the one restriction kind supported\n  (deliberate limitation).\n- **sos_257 / animation:** mutates the Land in place (adds CREATURE type and\n  Creature-style P/T attributes, `power`/`toughness` properties only become\n  usable after animation). The until-EOT pump mutates `modified_power`\n  directly and is cleared by `_reset_characteristics` during cleanup's\n  `apply_all` — the same path Creature pumps reset through. On re-entering\n  the battlefield the object de-animates (new-object semantics)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1409,"cache_read_input_tokens":236383,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1409},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae8e44fb-c1b4-40c8-a495-662bf5ed1b93","uuid":"fc8cc265-fbc8-4cb5-9e41-828727e92f0f","reques