{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018jbh54121gYQBin1wHUMKz","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae8e44fb-c1b4-40c8-a495-662bf5ed1b93","uuid":"8b31a100-2be1-4159-a3ae-d085e83fd44a","timestamp":"2026-06-11T03:08:36.795Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"- **sos_1 / \"may cast target\":** one prompt either way — unique candidate is\n  auto-selected with a yes/no for the \"may\"; multiple candidates use a single\n  `choose_card` where `None` declines.","newString":"- **sos_1 / \"may cast target\":** one prompt either way — unique candidate is\n  auto-selected with a yes/no for the \"may\"; multiple candidates use a single\n  `choose_card` where `None` declines.\n- **sos_257 / restricted mana:** `ManaPool` keeps a separate\n  `_restricted_pool`; `can_pay`/`pay` take `for_instant_sorcery=` (default\n  False → behavior unchanged). Restricted mana is spent before normal mana of\n  the same type. \"Instant/sorcery only\" is the one restriction kind supported\n  (deliberate limitation).\n- **sos_257 / animation:** mutates the Land in place (adds CREATURE type and\n  Creature-style P/T attributes, `power`/`toughness` properties only become\n  usable after animation). The until-EOT pump mutates `modified_power`\n  directly and is cleared by `_reset_characteristics` during cleanup's\n  `apply_all` — the same path Creature pumps reset through. On re-entering\n  the battlefield the object de-animates (new-object semantics).","originalFile":"# Key Decisions — SOS card implementation run\n\n- **E1 scope:** `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is fired from both `cast_spell` and\n  `cast_spell_free` — casting without paying a mana cost is still *casting*\n  (rule 601), and sos_226's Casualty / sos_257's pump must see free casts.\n  Copies made by `copy_spell` are not cast and correctly fire nothing.\n- **sos_1 / attacks event:** `AttacksTriggeredEvent` existed but was never\n  fired; the plan assumed it worked. Fired it in `declare_attackers_step`\n  after all attackers are registered (rule 508.2). Additive; engine_tests green.\n- **sos_1 / exile-instead:** `_resolve_spell` moved instants/sorceries to the\n  graveyard without consulting replacements. Added a\n  `SpellGoesToGraveyardReplacementEvent` passed from `_resolve_spell`, and\n  widened `move_to_zone`'s replacement gate to also apply for stack departures.\n  The card registers a one-shot replacement that unregisters itself after the\n  first redirect, so it cannot leak to later graveyard trips of the same card.\n- **sos_1 / \"may cast target\":** one prompt either way — unique candidate is\n  auto-selected with a yes/no for the \"may\"; multiple candidates use a single\n  `choose_card` where `None` declines.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":16,"oldLines":3,"newStart":16,"newLines":14,"lines":[" - **sos_1 / \"may cast target\":** one prompt either way — unique candidate is","   auto-selected with a yes/no for the \"may\"; multiple candidates use a single","   `choose_card` where `None` declines.","+- **sos_257 / restricted mana:** `ManaPool` keeps a separate","+  `_restricted_pool`; `can_pay`/`pay` take `for_instant_sorcery=` (default","+  False → behavior unchanged). Restricted mana is spent before normal mana of","+  the same type. \"Instant/sorcery only\" is the one restriction kind supported","+  (deliberate limitation).","+- **sos_257 / animation:** mutates the Land in place (adds CREATURE type and","+  Creature-style P/T attributes, `power`/`toughness` properties only become","+  usable after animation). The until-EOT pump mutates `modified_power`","+  directly and is cleared by `_reset_characteristics` during cleanup's","+  `apply_all` — the same path Creature pumps reset through. On re-entering","+  the battlefield the object de-animates (new-object semantics)."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
