{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_017AxDQgYAMa1CpZvb5fK1gm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0151r9JMXhqRoCXtZGUyeNQH","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"- **sos_257 / animation:**","new_string":"- **sos_201 / miracle:** first-draw tracking is card-local and turn-stamped,\n  counting only draws made while Lorehold is on the battlefield (draws made\n  earlier in the turn before it entered are not counted — deliberate\n  limitation). The miracle cast pays {2} from the pool (restricted\n  instant/sorcery mana allowed) and uses the free-cast stack path; the\n  reveal step of real miracle is not modeled.\n- **sos_257 / animation:**"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1684,"cache_read_input_tokens":297627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1684},"output_tokens":55,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae8e44fb-c1b4-40c8-a495-662bf5ed1b93","uuid":"e064e540-f72a-4a72-8703-b1dc6e95c718","request_id":"req_011Cbvkjg28vULmssggXforh"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0151r9JMXhqRoCXtZGUyeNQH","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae8e44fb-c1b4-40c8-a495-662bf5ed1b93","uuid":"295a3807-db2f-4c2b-a8bc-fc52b8cfae22","timestamp":"2026-06-11T03:22:43.911Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"- **sos_257 / animation:**","newString":"- **sos_201 / miracle:** first-draw tracking is card-local and turn-stamped,\n  counting only draws made while Lorehold is on the battlefield (draws made\n  earlier in the turn before it entered are not counted — deliberate\n  limitation). The miracle cast pays {2} from the pool (restricted\n  instant/sorcery mana allowed) and uses the free-cast stack path; the\n  reveal step of real miracle is not modeled.\n- **sos_257 / animation:**","originalFile":"# Key Decisions — SOS card implementation run\n\n- **E1 scope:** `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is fired from both `cast_spell` and\n  `cast_spell_free` — casting without paying a mana cost is still *casting*\n  (rule 601), and sos_226's Casualty / sos_257's pump must see free casts.\n  Copies made by `copy_spell` are not cast and correctly fire nothing.\n- **sos_1 / attacks event:** `AttacksTriggeredEvent` existed but was never\n  fired; the plan assumed it worked. Fired it in `declare_attackers_step`\n  after all attackers are registered (rule 508.2). Additive; engine_tests green.\n- **sos_1 / exile-instead:** `_resolve_spell` moved instants/sorceries to the\n  graveyard without consulting replacements. Added a\n  `SpellGoesToGraveyardReplacementEvent` passed from `_resolve_spell`, and\n  widened `move_to_zone`'s replacement gate to also apply for stack departures.\n  The card registers a one-shot replacement that unregisters itself after the\n  first redirect, so it cannot leak to later graveyard trips of the same card.\n- **sos_1 / \"may cast target\":** one prompt either way — unique candidate is\n  auto-selected with a yes/no for the \"may\"; multiple candidates use a single\n  `choose_card` where `None` declines.\n- **sos_257 / restricted mana:** `ManaPool` keeps a separate\n  `_restricted_pool`; `can_pay`/`pay` take `for_instant_sorcery=` (default\n  False → behavior unchanged). Restricted mana is spent before normal mana of\n  the same type. \"Instant/sorcery only\" is the one restriction kind supported\n  (deliberate limitation).\n- **sos_57 / mana spent:** added `card.mana_spent = effective_cost.cmc` at\n  payment time in `cast_spell` (the exact amount `pay()` deducts; X costs\n  unsupported) and `mana_spent = 0` in `cast_spell_free`. \"Your next main\n  phase\" is approximated as your next *precombat* main (E2 is the only\n  main-phase event); the Wizard check happens when the delayed trigger\n  resolves, and the trigger is spent either way (one-shot).\n- **sos_120 / Paradigm copy:** `copy_spell` only copies stack objects, and a\n  freshly built card-copy would linger as a zombie object after resolving.\n  Instead the recurring trigger recasts the *original* card from exile with a\n  one-shot exile-redirect, so it returns to exile each time — observably the\n  same as \"cast a copy from exile\". \"First resolve\" is guarded with a\n  name-keyed set on the controller so re-resolutions never duplicate the\n  recurring trigger.\n- **sos_13 / prepared:** rule 722.3 (rulebook is SOS-aware): the Swords copy\n  is created in exile when the creature becomes prepared, is cast for its\n  normal cost {W} (no \"without paying\" in the reminder text — deviates from\n  TODO's `cast_spell_free`-only suggestion; payment is taken in the ability\n  cost, the stack path is `cast_spell_free`), unprepares at cast time\n  (601.2i), and ceases to exist after resolving (704.5e) via a one-shot\n  prevented-move replacement. The cast is exposed as activated ability index\n  0 — the engine's only elective-action entry point. ETB effect lives in\n  `on_resolve` (fdn_205 pattern; the engine never fires a permanent's own\n  ETB trigger for its own entry), counting the entering creature itself.\n- **sos_257 / animation:** mutates the Land in place (adds CREATURE type and\n  Creature-style P/T attributes, `power`/`toughness` properties only become\n  usable after animation). The until-EOT pump mutates `modified_power`\n  directly and is cleared by `_reset_characteristics` during cleanup's\n  `apply_all` — the same path Creature pumps reset through. On re-entering\n  the battlefield the object de-animates (new-object semantics).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":44,"oldLines":6,"newStart":44,"newLines":12,"lines":["   0 — the engine's only elective-action entry point. ETB effect lives in","   `on_resolve` (fdn_205 pattern; the engine never fires a permanent's own","   ETB trigger for its own entry), counting the entering creature itself.","+- **sos_201 / miracle:** first-draw tracking is card-local and turn-stamped,","+  counting only draws made while Lorehold is on the battlefield (draws made","+  earlier in the turn before it entered are not counted — deliberate","+  limitation). The miracle cast pays {2} from the pool (restricted","+  instant/sorcery mana allowed) and uses the free-cast stack path; the","+  reveal step of real miracle is not modeled."," - **sos_257 / animation:** mutates the Land in place (adds CREATURE type and","   Creature-style P/T attributes, `power`/`toughness` properties only become","   usable after animation). The until-EOT pump mutates `modified_power`"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
