{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01VYUBcjSSfYeoQm8WUCJN2y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 13 checklist items are done — the run is complete. Working tree is clean, every item has its own commit, and the final suite is green: **1246 passed** (1145 engine regression tests + FDN reference tests + 57 new SOS tests), with all ten card classes importing cleanly, constructing bare, and matching their spec names.\n\n**What was built**\n\n*Shared engine seams (E1–E3, all additive):*\n- **E1** — `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from `cast_spell` *and* `cast_spell_free` (free casts are still casts; `copy_spell` copies correctly fire nothing).\n- **E2** — new `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent`, fired from `GameState.advance_phase` after `empty_mana_pools()`, so it behaves identically for run-turn and direct advances.\n- **E3** — `get_cost_reduction` now aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` from the caster's battlefield permanents for instant/sorcery spells.\n\n*Ten cards, each with 4–8 real-engine tests plus an independent throwaway smoke check:* Together as One (converge off `colors_spent`), The Dawning Archaic (graveyard cost reduction, attack-trigger free cast, exile-instead replacement), Witherbloom (affinity self + grant via E3), Silverquill (Casualty 1 with optional retargeted copy), Great Hall of the Biblioplex (two mana abilities, instant/sorcery-restricted mana, in-place 2/4 Wizard animation with until-EOT pump), Mana Sculpt (Refute-style counter + delayed `{C}` via E2), Improvisation Capstone (exile-until-MV-4, free casts, recurring Paradigm recast), Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares (Inkling token, rule-722 prepared copy cast from exile for `{W}`), Lorehold (miracle `{2}` on first draw, opponent-upkeep loot), and Ral Zarek (surveil, targeted discard, reanimation, seeded coin flips + skip-turns).\n\n**Notable plan deviations** (all logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md` and noted in `TODO.md`): `AttacksTriggeredEvent` existed but was never fired — now fired in `declare_attackers_step`; spells resolving stack→graveyard now consult replacement effects (new `SpellGoesToGraveyardReplacementEvent`); the prepared Swords copy pays its normal `{W}` cost per the rulebook's reminder-text semantics rather than being fully free; Paradigm recasts the original from exile rather than `copy_spell` (which only copies stack objects). Card-local gaps — restricted mana, land animation, miracle tracking, `game.rng`, `Player.skip_turns` — were each kept to the smallest additive edit with commented limitations, and no existing engine symbols were renamed, moved, or deleted."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":461,"cache_read_input_tokens":316794,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":461},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae8e44fb-c1b4-40c8-a495-662bf5ed1b93","uuid":"b5dd4107-7136-4c4f-ba88-b37962d7aac2","request_id":"req_011Cbvm5CT15fbPes5hLhFUa"}
